
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B{D1: Dues < 0?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Raise Invalid Dues]
    B -- No --> D{D2-A: Enrollment invalid?}

    D -- Yes --> E[Raise Invalid Capacity]
    D -- No --> F{D2-B: Capacity < 1?}

    F -- Yes --> E
    F -- No --> G{D3: Dues > 1000?}

    G -- Yes --> H[Return DUES_BLOCK]
    G -- No --> I{D4: Already Registered?}

    I -- Yes --> J[Return ALREADY_REGISTERED]
    I -- No --> K{D5: Prerequisites Missing?}

    K -- Yes --> L[Return PREREQUISITES_MISSING]
    K -- No --> M{D6: Credit Limit Exceeded?}

    M -- Yes --> N[Return CREDIT_LIMIT]
    M -- No --> O{D7: Enrolled > Capacity?}

    O -- Yes --> P[Return WAITLISTED]
    O -- No --> Q[Return REGISTERED]

    C --> R([End])
    E --> R
    H --> R
    J --> R
    L --> R
    N --> R
    P --> R
    Q --> R

